{"server":"tw","storyId":"act20side_level_act20side_04_end","groupId":"act20side","stageId":"act20side_04","title":"“大水坑”","storyCode":"IC-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"752da2fe97e63ac0041a0e75420a4ea45e48d7ceaacbdb63f8923f5e7870217e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“大水坑”拆除在即，眾人在這裡最後玩了個痛快。杜林人們期待著下一個地標的誕生，依娜姆也與嘉維爾討論著阿卡胡拉的未來。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g2_fountainlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據大家表決的結果，陪伴了我們半年多的“大水坑”即將完成它的歷史使命。它會被爆破拆解，重新回歸為工程材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"市民們，這場稍微延長了一點的夏日狂歡恐怕即將結束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，我會永遠記得這段美好的時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"超級旋轉大滑梯真是怎麼玩都玩不夠，居然就要和它告別了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過！取代“大水坑”的，會是更新的，更美的，更不一樣的建築！！畢竟這裡可是際崖城，是最棒的建築設計師們締造的城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇·畫布和卡奇·敘光是際崖城新生代裡最引人矚目的建築設計師，他們會在未來的幾個月裡交出自己的設計方案......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，又會是一場怎樣的強者對決呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼呼，簡直讓人想起幾年前，他們初露鋒芒的時候，圍繞著穹頂的那場競標大賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年的穹頂之爭沒有勝利者，那麼這次，誰會取得下一個際崖城地標的設計權呢？讓我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先喝口水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克羅綺，你今天這個狀態，不會是喝了酒來的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這風格可不像你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆給我看的錄影裡，地上的比賽中有一個職位叫做主持人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算拓展一下職業路徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之！建築設計師們的設計雖然暫時還等不來，但是，市民們，這個夏天的尾巴可是稍縱即逝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我們在滑梯消失前的最後時間裡，去玩它個爽吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦！！！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，小心！你慢點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前你們在阿卡胡拉的大瀑布玩水，我聽說了以後可是羡慕了好久呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，這次我也可以加入啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？平常你都小心翼翼地藏著尾巴，這麼一看，是不是又變粗了點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？才沒有！我來之前才剛用卷尺量過！已經好幾個月沒有變粗了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看來真的很在意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚，看我的潑水攻擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很大膽嘛！來就來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們似乎比你更像杜林人呢，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也未必知道什麼叫“杜林人”，魯珀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像有點緊張，在擔心和卡奇的競標嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擔心他？笑話！我還沒淪落到擔心比不過卡奇的境地。不過是他的方案一向比較招外行人的喜歡罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有些人是比較看好我的方案的，或許我該拿出點不同的風格，好贏過那傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然乾脆......唉！現在還是別想了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實話，如果不論美學，僅從可玩度上而言，這“大水坑”也還算湊合吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你也會享受這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，你在這啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不想感受下流速全開滑梯的威力？因為會對設備有損耗，平常可沒這機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛和極境哥試了幾次，那種速度感！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過掉進水裡的時候會有點疼，你要不要試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我對這種玩法可沒有一點興趣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喲吼，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇老弟，這衝擊力，沒的說！水花居然能濺這麼高！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要不試試換種玩法，比如說......比誰的水花小？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"壓水花？好思路！聽起來不會那麼疼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的沙堡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（卡奇老弟，我們是不是惹禍了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，就算是斯第奇，也不至於為了沙堡生氣吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可他看起來就是生氣了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不然我們......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼跑了？你們兩個，給我回來！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，情緒調動相當不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是我學習的成果，感謝這些錄影帶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，我們可以用一系列的比賽，維持住“競賽”這個概念的熱潮，再借著幾個月後卡奇和斯第奇的競標，把氣氛推到最高點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是可以印發一批小紙片，讓觀眾們可以借此表達自己對某一方的支持，最後如果猜對了會有點獎品之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我們管這東西叫獎券，克羅綺你真是無師自通。地上的商人們可是把這東西當做自己斂財的手段呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜林人對這樣賺錢可沒興趣......不如讓輸的那一方承包勝利者一個月的酒吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，刺激一點承包兩個月也行。這個可以由投票決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後關於輸幾個月酒的競猜或許也能再發一批獎券......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......我開始擔心際崖城市民的未來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這種其實沒派上什麼用場的感覺真是難得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？你一定得揍些什麼才滿意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果順利的話，阿卡胡拉能收獲些杜林的技術，這就不算白回來一趟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"avg_npc_572_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾雖然很早就離開了家，但其實還蠻關心阿卡胡拉的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就算看過了各種各樣的地方，還是雨林裡最讓我安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"那你會回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時還沒這個打算。我在羅德島上還有病人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"相當多提亞卡烏希望你回去，你甚至可以考慮成為王酋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還希望地上會直接長蕉果。這片大地總不會遂了每個人的願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾，你來擔任阿卡胡拉的王酋是最合適的，只有你才能鎮住所有提亞卡烏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都在期待著你的回歸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"而如果你實在不願意，那麼，最後結果可能會變成薩爾貢宮廷派一個王酋來管理阿卡胡拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，阿卡胡拉一定不會再像如今這麼自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，不是還有你這個大酋長嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，有些事情我是沒辦法做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"依娜姆","speakerId":"avg_npc_075","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以想辦法幫大家從外面倒一點破爛回來。但真正能夠把提亞卡烏緊緊擰成一條藤蔓的，不會是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆，我也並不是在逃避責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我還沒想好怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉維爾居然在“想”，真難得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，祖瑪瑪，想打架嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，嘉維爾一般都是做了再去想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於我自己，或許可以。但如果關於這麼多提亞卡烏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該結束的總會結束，不是嗎，就像是這大滑梯一樣，拆掉，然後會建新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我剛才沒聽見你們在聊什麼啦，我只是想說，朋友們，趁它還沒消失，我來給你們拍張合照吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，也好，複雜的東西暫時放到一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下先要盡興！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，你也笑起來！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你們已經學會杜林人的哲學了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟休個假可不容易，怎麼能浪費呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好，我該敬你一杯！想嘗嘗漿果番茄酒嗎？我請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉維爾","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這個還是算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i04"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g2_fountainlake"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g3_fountainlake_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，消失得很輕盈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會喝得爛醉如泥，然後錯過目睹這玩意被炸掉的美好景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我只是比較擅長享受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，在這種時候，我更傾向於保持清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我對正在消逝之物最基本的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，難道你其實是個深藏不露的聰明人？這種人設就算是在際崖城的圖書館藏書中也算是爛俗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這小子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就是要動真格的了，我們公平競爭，各憑本事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·敘光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不介意的話，握個手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，出於對另一位際崖城公民最基本的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_571_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，你們是不是其實關係蠻好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用哪隻眼睛看出來的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就是要動真格的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·畫布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......克羅綺什麼時候又喝上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預熱的預熱，前奏的前奏，際崖城大競技系列第一季！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰卡恰卡恰卡恰卡——咚咚！游泳大賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克羅綺·磚石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位，有沒有興趣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
